- result: Oph IRS 63 streamers S1 and S2 model parameters (theta0, phi0, R_C) = S1: 50 deg, 130 deg, 1'' (~130 au); S2: 80 deg, 200 deg, 0.6'' (~80 au) ± theta0 ~10 deg deg, deg, arcsec [Table 1: "S1 | 50 | 130"]
